        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">What this website collects, why, and who handles it.</p>
        <p class="text-page-updated">Last updated {{ updated }}</p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>Arbur CPA is the accounting practice of Arwa Naalwala, CPA. This notice covers this website: the contact form, the booking calendar, and calls and texts to our business number. It doesn&rsquo;t cover the files we keep for clients, which we handle under our professional confidentiality obligations and the terms of each engagement.</p>

        <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address and message, so we can reply.</li>
          <li><strong>Booking calendar:</strong> your first and last name and email address, so we can confirm your consultation and send you the video call link.</li>
          <li><strong>Calls and texts:</strong> your phone number and what you tell us, so we can answer.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We use this only to respond to you and arrange your consultation. We don&rsquo;t sell it, share it for marketing, or add you to a mailing list.</p>

        <h2>Services that handle it</h2>
        <p>Your information is stored by the services we use to run this website and talk with you. Some of them store it in the United States.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Formspree</strong> receives contact form messages and emails them to us. (<a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree&rsquo;s privacy policy</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Google</strong> runs the booking calendar, our business phone number and our email. The booking calendar is Google&rsquo;s own page shown inside this one, so it loads as you scroll near it, and Google sees your IP address even if you don&rsquo;t book. (<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google&rsquo;s privacy policy</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>GitHub</strong> hosts this website, and logs visitors&rsquo; IP addresses for security. (<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub&rsquo;s privacy statement</a>)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising trackers. Google&rsquo;s booking calendar may set its own cookies, for example to check for spam.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask what information we have about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.privacyEmail }}">{{ site.privacyEmail }}</a>.</p>

        <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
        <p>Arwa Naalwala, CPA, is responsible for how we handle personal information. If you&rsquo;re not satisfied with our answer to a privacy question, you can contact the <a href="https://www.priv.gc.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada</a>, or in Quebec, the <a href="https://www.cai.gouv.qc.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Commission d&rsquo;accès à l&rsquo;information</a>.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this notice changes, we&rsquo;ll update it here and change the date at the top.</p>
